  "promptSpec": {
    "id": "mammal-pod",
    "generator": "OpenAI imagegen built-in",
    "prompt": "Use case stylized-concept. Original fan-made 2D game pixel-art sprites of the Mammal Pod / BS-Imago AI cylinder from Metal Gear Solid Peace Walker, accurately based on the actual Boss AI pod geometry also preserved in MGSV Mother Base. Tall dark charcoal steel vertical CYLINDER, narrow cylindrical column about 2.5 times as tall as its diameter, many vertical metal segmented panels, squat circular supporting base, black rounded topcap with small offset antenna, concentric bright red horizontal grille rings directly beneath the top, large circular RED optical lens on upper front below the rings, additional subtle red lower vent ring. No robot arms, no legs, no tank chassis, no face, no human, not a rectangular computer cabinet, not a giant humanoid Metal Gear. Detailed crisp pixel-art industrial metal with small red status lights. EXACT4columns×4rows=16 individually drawn wholepod phases, same side/front-threequarter readable lens angle and consistent scale, base on identical baseline. Thin cyan equal-cell grid, pureflat#FF00FF magenta background. Pod occupies at most60% of each square cell height, with generous clear margins allaround; entirely contained in eachcell. This is a STATIONARY device: rows show changing real hardware lights/doors not walking. Row1 idle four sequential red diagnostic light/ring changes with tiny antenna angle changes. Row2 scan four phases optical lens aiming slightly right, returning center, aiming slightly left, center. Row3 interact four access-panel phases closed, slightly open, fully open showing narrow orange/blue memory circuitry, closing. Row4 react four warning-system phases red pulse bright, dim, red pulse, normal with antenna stabilized. Pod body geometry unchanged, no explosions or displacement, no field aura. No text labels, UI, captions, symbols, logos, shadow plane, scenery or clipped parts.",
    "generatedFile": "exec-eae6b21e-7a0e-4dbd-8dd2-7896bb6ffd49.png",
    "referenceUrls": [
      "https://www.creativeuncut.com/gallery-12/mgspw-ai-pod.html",
      "https://chrism227.wordpress.com/2017/03/29/metal-gear-profiles-the-boss-part-iv-the-ai-mammal-pod-bs-imagopeace-walker-basilisk/"
    ],
    "review": "Generated image visually reviewed for source silhouette and intact authored poses. Original pixel adaptation. References include mirrored official concept art or game-model fan renders, not redistributed official game files. No 1:1 claim.",
    "limitations": [
      "1974 device geometry cross-checked against the preserved 1984 AI pod; precise 1974 condition is an adaptation."
    ]
  },
